# Corpsejack Menace doubles +1/+1 counters put on "a creature you control"; Ozolith, the Shattered Spire adds one to those put on
# "an artifact or creature you control" (CR 614.1a, 122.6). Ozolith's ability puts one counter on Bot1's Sol Ring, an artifact
# that is no creature: the Menace does not apply, and Ozolith makes it 2. Two turns later it puts one on Bot1's Ornithopter, an
# artifact creature: both apply, Bot1 chooses the Menace first (CR 616.1), 1 becomes 2, Ozolith is judged again and adds one
# (CR 616.1f): 3, where Ozolith first would have made (1 + 1) x 2 = 4.

